      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我担心她这样下去会渐渐疏远，\n会不会有一天变得孤独。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d631c4f5ea4c5350d5499498883e1ec8ca60d5791beec8364bf719c1e4964cc0",
