    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9ebacd9fab377322756d6fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大概是想在容易变得孤独的自主训练中，\n能够在不经意间关注她的状态吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "903d1e9a5e38db2c8e58c028ffc96af57419f76b7c1e7e79a518e08584db19d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:987bd6cad95a8f0dd8b37a3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "明白了。别勉强自己，就这么办吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "e532d6635fec8a45f4759fb7bf521690767ec43ce8df3a489362e0b2a3d5871a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
