      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日暮迟迟的冬日天空下，唯有那一处，\n摇曳着柔和的灯光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "320f9125ac1b136a5b117618ed1b8e539e1a0f3dc76c145090bff9f7181c0082",
